    "description": "Mineral and Rock Specimen Set with Labeled Plastic Cases 20+ Samples\nThis listing includes two plastic cases labeled 'Minerals,' each containing multiple raw, unpolished mineral and rock specimens. Each compartment is labeled with the mineral name, featuring samples such as Hematite, Mica, Amazonite, Copper Ore, Gold, Jasper, Selenite, Variscite, Talc, Alabaster, Turquoise, Pyrite, Chalcopyrite, Amethyst, Smoky Quartz, Rose Quartz, Fluorite, Galena, and more. The minerals vary in color, shape, and size, and are organized in clear plastic cases for easy viewing. The set is in good used condition and suitable for collectors, educators, or hobbyists interested in geology and earth sciences.\nProduct Size:\n11 x 6.25 x 4.85 in\n5.8 lb",
