    "description": "Title:\nStones Collection Sample Box Rock Mineral Specimens Educational Set\nCondition:\nUsed\nCondition Description:\nGood - some signs of use on trays and rocks\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nProduct Category:\nCollectibles > Rocks, Fossils & Minerals > Other Rocks\nDescription:\nExplore the wonders of geology with this educational rock and mineral collection set, featuring two sturdy blue storage cases. Each case contains neatly organized, assorted stone and mineral samplesmaking them ideal for students, collectors, or curious minds. Each sample is housed in its own compartment, clearly labeled for ease of identification and study. The cases open to allow easy access and display, while the fitted trays keep all pieces securely in place. These stones display a variety of textures, colors, and patterns, representing a wide range of geological types. Perfect for classroom demonstrations or home education, the samples appear to be in good condition, with visible minor wear and slight residue in some trays, consistent with previous use. Ideal for hands-on learning, these sets allow close examination and comparison, fostering an appreciation for earth sciences. A practical and engaging resource, these collections are ready to spark discovery and inquiry.",
